          "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
          "Label": "BACKGROUND",
          "content": "Shirley Learthart examines the potential adverse effects to health of working on rotating shifts."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSION",
          "content": "Many studies indicate that shift work can cause health problems, including increased risk of coronary heart disease. Internal rotation is the reason given by many nurses for leaving the profession."
        }
